    "created_at": "2023-07-17T13:43:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-07-17T13:43:15Z",
    "body": "`loadState` is only defined for graph loads initiated by HTML (i.e. `<script>` tags) and not for those initiated by ECMA-262 (i.e. dynamic `import()`).\r\n\r\nWith this PR, step 11.2 of [`HostLoadImportedModule`](https://whatpr.org/html/9520/webappapis.html#hostloadimportedmodule) gets `settingsObject` from `loadState`, when it is defined. Step 1 is a \"default value\" needed as a fallback for the `import()` case with no referrer (i.e. `<button onclick=\"import('./a')\"></button>`), and step 6.2 overwrites it with a fallback default value for all the other dynamic `import()` cases.",
